  "ruleText": "Rev 1001.21 “Wholesaler” means “wholesaler,” as defined in RSA 78:1, XIV, licensed by the department, pursuant to RSA 78.\n\nSource. #10536, eff 3-6-14 (from Rev 1001.12); renumbered by #12639 (formerly Rev 1001.18); ss by #13049, eff 6-4-20 (formerly Rev 1001.21) (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Rev 1000); ss by #13817, eff 12-1-23 (formerly Rev 1001.19) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Rev 1000)",
